/* Claude Sign-In Helper: Simplified Chinese. The English text is the key. */

/* Sign-in screen: headlines */
"Bring your Safari sign-in to Claude Desktop" = "将 Safari 的登录带到 Claude Desktop";
"Quit Claude Desktop first" = "请先退出 Claude Desktop";
"Ready to import" = "可以导入了";
"Claude Desktop already has a sign-in" = "Claude Desktop 已有登录信息";
"Confirm the sign-in" = "确认登录";
"Sign-in imported" = "登录信息已导入";
"Sign-in confirmed" = "登录已确认";
"Not confirmed yet" = "尚未确认";

/* Sign-in screen: explanations */
"Turn on Claude Sign-In Helper in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, then quit and reopen it." = "请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“完全磁盘访问权限”中打开 Claude Sign-In Helper，然后退出并重新打开它。";
"Make sure Claude works in Safari, then quit Claude Desktop with ⌘Q." = "请确认 Claude 在 Safari 中可以正常使用，然后按 ⌘Q 退出 Claude Desktop。";
"It’s still running. Press ⌘Q in Claude Desktop (closing its window isn’t enough), then check again." = "它仍在运行。请在 Claude Desktop 中按 ⌘Q（仅关闭窗口是不够的），然后再检查一次。";
"Found %@ and your Safari sign-in. A backup is saved before anything changes." = "已找到 %@ 和你的 Safari 登录信息。在进行任何更改前会先保存备份。";
"There’s nothing to import. Its saved sign-in is left as it is." = "无需导入。其已保存的登录信息会保持不变。";
"Once Claude Desktop has loaded, check that it reported a successful sign-in." = "等 Claude Desktop 加载完成后，检查它是否报告登录成功。";
"Open Claude Desktop so it can finish signing in, then confirm it here." = "打开 Claude Desktop 以完成登录，然后回到这里确认。";
"Claude Desktop reported a successful sign-in. Check that it shows the account you expect." = "Claude Desktop 报告登录成功。请检查它显示的是否为你预期的账户。";
"Claude may still be loading. If it asks you to sign in, sign out of Claude in Safari and back in, then import again." = "Claude 可能仍在加载。如果它要求你登录，请在 Safari 中退出 Claude 并重新登录，然后再次导入。";
"Checking only reads. Nothing leaves this Mac." = "检查只会读取数据，不会有任何数据离开这台 Mac。";
"Step %lld of 4" = "第 %lld 步，共 4 步";

