"Anthropic’s sign-in help ↗" = "Anthropic 的登录帮助 ↗";

/* Confirmation alerts */
"Import your Safari sign-in?" = "要导入你的 Safari 登录信息吗？";
"A private backup is saved first, so you can undo this. If macOS asks about “Claude Safe Storage,” choose Allow, and type your password only in that macOS dialog. Keep Claude Desktop closed until it finishes." = "会先保存一份私密备份，以便之后撤销。如果 macOS 询问“Claude Safe Storage”，请选择“允许”，并且只在该 macOS 对话框中输入密码。完成之前请保持 Claude Desktop 处于关闭状态。";
"Undo this import?" = "要撤销这次导入吗？";
"Quit Claude Desktop first. Only the imported Claude cookies are replaced, and nothing changes if Desktop has a newer sign-in. This doesn’t sign out server sessions." = "请先退出 Claude Desktop。只会替换导入的 Claude Cookie；如果 Desktop 已有更新的登录，则不会做任何更改。此操作不会注销服务器上的会话。";

/* Backups sheet */
"A backup is saved before every import. Restore one to undo it." = "每次导入前都会保存备份。恢复某个备份即可撤销对应的导入。";
"Quit Claude Desktop before restoring. Only the imported Claude cookies are replaced, and server sessions aren’t signed out." = "恢复前请退出 Claude Desktop。只会替换导入的 Claude Cookie，服务器上的会话不会被注销。";
"Import undone. The original cookies were restored." = "已撤销导入，原始 Cookie 已恢复。";
"No backups yet." = "还没有备份。";
"Your backups will appear here." = "你的备份会显示在这里。";
"Saved import" = "已保存的导入";
"Restored" = "已恢复";
"Before an import" = "导入前";

/* How it works sheet */
"What you need" = "准备工作";
"Claude signed in to Safari, and Claude Desktop opened once, then quit with ⌘Q." = "在 Safari 中已登录 Claude，并且已打开过一次 Claude Desktop，然后按 ⌘Q 退出。";
"If macOS blocks access" = "如果 macOS 阻止访问";
"Allow this app in Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, then reopen it. Only do this if you trust it." = "在“隐私与安全性”→“完全磁盘访问权限”中允许此 App，然后重新打开它。请仅在信任此 App 时这样做。";
"The Keychain prompt" = "钥匙串提示";
"If macOS asks about “Claude Safe Storage,” choose Allow. It may ask twice. Type your password only in that dialog." = "如果 macOS 询问“Claude Safe Storage”，请选择“允许”。可能会询问两次。只在该对话框中输入密码。";
"Privacy" = "隐私";
"Runs only on this Mac, with no network requests. Reads only Claude’s sign-in cookies; Safari isn’t changed." = "仅在这台 Mac 上运行，不发出任何网络请求。只读取 Claude 的登录 Cookie，不会更改 Safari。";
"Limits" = "限制";
"Independent utility. Safari’s default profile and one Claude session only." = "独立工具。仅支持 Safari 的默认描述文件和一个 Claude 会话。";

